    <string name="call_recording_notice_title">Recording notice</string>
    <string name="call_recording_notice_summary">Call recording may be regulated where you live. You are responsible for following the law and getting consent when required.</string>
    <string name="call_recording_notice_read">Read full notice</string>
    <string name="call_recording_info">Recording phone calls may be subject to legal regulations, restrictions, or requirements to notify or obtain the consent of call participants in some countries or under certain circumstances.\n\nBefore using this feature, make sure that its use complies with the laws and other rules applicable in your country or location.\n\nYou are solely responsible for how you use the call recording feature, including compliance with all applicable legal obligations and obtaining any required consent.\n\nThe app developer does not provide legal advice and is not responsible for the use of this feature in violation of applicable laws.\n\nBy using the call recording feature, you confirm that you have read and understood this notice and acknowledge it.\n\nRecording uses the Shizuku app. Starting Shizuku with an authorization key requires the thedjchi Shizuku fork: https://github.com/thedjchi/Shizuku/releases/tag/v13.7.0-thedjchi\n\nRecording availability and quality depend on your device; some devices do not provide call audio.</string>
